# Banking Dashboard Screenshots

## Overview
This folder contains screenshots of the Czechoslovakia Bank Power BI dashboard, presenting banking performance, customer demographics, loan analysis, and product insights.

## Dashboard Pages

### 1. Bank Performance
Provides an overview of banking performance through key metrics and visualizations to support monitoring of financial and operational trends.

### 2. Customer Demographics
Presents customer demographic information and geographical distribution to help understand the bank's customer base.

### 3. Loans Analysis
Highlights loan-related metrics and visualizations to support analysis of the bank's loan portfolio.

### 4. Products Analysis
Presents product-related metrics and visualizations to help explore banking product performance.

## Tools Used
- Microsoft Power BI
- SQL

## Purpose
These dashboard screenshots demonstrate how banking data can be presented through interactive visualizations to support business analysis and management decision-making.
